OL,3,GNEWSAPolice go undercover to protect
OL,4,Afemale runners
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new undercover police initiative is
OL,7,Faiming to stamp out harassment towards
OL,8,Fwomen exercising in public.
OL,10,FGroups of female Cambridgeshire Police
OL,11,Fofficers took part in undercover
OL,12,Foperations on Monday and Wednesday in
OL,13,Fareas of Huntingdon and Cambridge where
OL,14,Frunners had reported feeling unsafe.
OL,16,FA survey of more than 2,500 runners by
OL,17,Fthe police force found that almost
OL,18,Feight in 10 women had felt unsafe while
OL,19,Frunning, compared with 35% of men.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
