OL,3,GNEWSAPolice go undercover to protect
OL,4,Afemale runners
OL,5,
OL,6,FSgt Barbara Williams, one of the
OL,7,Fundercover officers, urged anyone who
OL,8,Ffaced abuse while exercising outside to
OL,9,Freport their experiences to the police.
